00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:41.250
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:50.080
Chapter 12 Big Brother

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:55.630
Mother! Mother!

00:01:56.870 --> 00:01:59.800
There, now, what's wrong?

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:08.410
And I have to turn these in to
the teacher at the temple school.

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:23.290
If he's gonna be like this,
I wish I didn't have a kid brother.

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:26.870
You shouldn't say such things, Tatsunosuke.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:38.080
You're a big brother now.
Go a little easy on him.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:39.580
But...

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:43.120
Besides which, I hardly approve
of your use of violence.

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.800
Conflict will only give
rise to other conflicts.

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:50.790
All right, I'll tell you what.
I'll help you out,

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:52.190
so let's get it written again.

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:56.860
You can't do that! It's homework,
so I have to do it myself!

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:02.450
That's right!

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:09.290
Tatsunosuke, your integrity
and honesty are beautiful.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:12.880
While you're at it,
forgive Tetsunosuke too.

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:19.750
He's still little and just doesn't
know right from wrong, that's all.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:20.870
Yeah...

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:22.500
Okay, Father.

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:23.720
No, no!

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.470
Call me Papa.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:33.620
Father, I can't breathe
if you hold me so tight.

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:38.780
Father? I can't...
My, tomatoes.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:42.110
I can't breathe! Father!

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:45.080
I can't breathe!

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.950
Father, I can't breathe!

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:55.830
I really can't breathe!

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:06.450
Tetsu...

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.100
I...

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:13.540
I'm totally stuffed.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:16.480
That's way too cliché.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:27.200
Man... I wash and I wash,
but there's no end to it!

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:28.780
Fine, then...

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.790
Tetsunosuke Style,

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.780
the Secret Technique of Hanging
Two Sheets to Dry At Once!

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:45.540
Oh, man!

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:57.230
So it's not only tea that you can't
do satisfactorily, but laundry too.

00:04:57.540 --> 00:04:58.360
Do it over.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:11.910
That's not true at all.
What have you been trying to say?

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.870
Really, Momma, what you're
saying doesn't make sense.

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:31.200
<i>Saya...</i>

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:41.000
<i>Come to think of it, all I know
about her is her name.</i>

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.790
Did you see that, Missus Harada?

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:48.700
That Tetsunosuke boy of the
Ichimuras' is looking at women!

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:53.040
Does that mean at fifteen, he's finally
awakened to his male instincts?

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.620
No, that sad look in his eyes says

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.200
he's undoubtedly seeing
someone else in that woman.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:05:59.210
Which means...

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:04.790
But you know, if he's seeing her in that
woman, would that mean she's a married woman?

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:07.050
Man, even his first romance is intense.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:10.470
Anyway, if he can just get into
the house, he's got it, right?

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:14.890
No, I feel sorry for him, but first
romances have gotta be bittersweet.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:18.270
Like she'll say, "No,
you're still a child"?

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:22.540
Not likely! I'm telling you, with
the target, it'll be mm-mm-good!

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:24.730
What is going to be mm-mm-good?

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.160
When in the heck...?!

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:31.040
I saw something dark over here.

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:35.120
Yes, a murky fog-like thing.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:38.660
Hey, does he mean us?

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:40.160
Probably.

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:45.160
No, it seems it was just
my imagination. Excuse me.

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:46.260
Hold on a second!

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:49.540
Hey, Heisuke?

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.010
What're you thinking?

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:52.500
You dummies.

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:54.120
When we're up to something fun like this,

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.520
it'd be better if we got Hajime
to help us out too, right?

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:06.980
So, how'd it end up that I
have to spar with Mr. Saito?

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:10.250
You moron, what're you being so picky for?!

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:11.370
That's right!

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:14.200
Hajime sparring with you for practice

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.500
is something that might
happen once a year, if that!

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.700
Or rather, it's truly a miracle!

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.750
Go for it and learn something from him!

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:23.080
I don't really get what's going on,

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:25.200
but Mr. Saito, is this really okay?

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:26.420
I don't mind.

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:28.540
In that case...

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:32.300
<i>If I'm getting to practice against a
swordsman as good as Mr. Okita...</i>

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:35.720
Guess I'll just have to
give it my all, right?!

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:57.870
I can see it.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:04.330
It seems there is someone you cannot
forget about, even for a moment.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.470
Ouch!

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:19.000
That puppy boy...
He's definitely disturbed by it!

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.980
Oh, man, Hajime sure is a mean one, too.

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.730
One more time!

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:27.520
But no matter how you wish it,

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:32.080
you will not be able to see that person.

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:36.790
Mr. Saito, what are you talking about?

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:39.450
Come on, now, you're just playing dumb!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.160
We know all about it. <i>All </i>about it.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.950
I can see it.

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:45.040
So, like I asked...

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:48.920
Not the eyes of one of the
deceased, but one who is alive.

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:52.130
What's that...?

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.840
It was all in the past.

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:59.830
Hey, man, Hajime's really
getting into this.

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:04.850
And all I asked was for him to
tease puppy boy just a little.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.110
What is this?!

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:20.370
Now!

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:30.640
Tatsunosuke!

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:35.720
Hello. You seem awfully happy, Mr. Okita.

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:41.040
Yes, I heard Tetsu is sparring
with Hajime for practice,

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.470
so I'm going over there to watch.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:46.660
Whoops.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:49.230
You idiot!

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:54.740
You're Mr. Hijikata's page and yet
you're still doing that sort of thing?!

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:57.030
Tetsu!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.040
Yo...

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:06.790
Well, I think Hajime accidentally
got a bit serious and...

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.120
It was a bamboo sword,

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:11.200
but it might've been dicey if he
wasn't wearing any protectors.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:12.460
Just kidding...

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:18.620
Hey, Tetsu! Hang in there!

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:20.080
I'm...

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:22.380
totally stuffed...

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:26.730
I'm sorry.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:29.910
I'm sorry.

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:34.490
Through him, I saw eyes that
shone eerily, and that was why.

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:38.590
Eyes?

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.330
How unexpected.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:47.580
That you would deliver a serious blow...

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.250
He was fast, wasn't he?

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:54.460
He surprised me a little.

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:00.220
It's too much.

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:04.790
Tetsu was certainly at fault for
sparring when he is only a page,

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:08.060
but to strike down such a
novice with serious force!

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:10.090
It's too terrible!

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:14.800
I'm so sorry!

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.910
I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:18.250
I'm a mere bookkeeper,

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:20.950
and it was unconscionable
of me to address you that way!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.160
Well...

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.370
We're sorry.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.560
<i>Owowowow...</i>

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:55.560
<i>Not the eyes of one of the
deceased, but one who is alive.</i>

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:58.350
<i>It was all in the past.</i>

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:01.790
<i>Was that...?</i>

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:04.530
What might be the matter, Tetsunosuke?

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:07.040
Mr. Yamanami...

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:11.830
Are you still dealing with the aches
from your match with Saito?

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.710
That's part of it, but...

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:15.910
You'd better not push yourself.

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:21.640
After all, being Hijikata's page is one
of the toughest jobs you could have.

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.700
No, well...

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:26.830
I haven't been doing a lot
of page work anyway.

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:29.840
Someone in your position needs relaxation.

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:35.660
So that you can forget the mundane
hardships, even for a fleeting moment.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:37.730
Relaxation in the true sense of the word.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.950
My, how handsome!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.290
Oh, my, how truly adorable!

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:57.200
Isn't he?! He's that Mr. Hijikata's page!

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:58.940
Really?

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:00.050
Fifteen years old?

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:05.660
I swear, I've never seen such a cute
Shinsengumi member in my life!

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:06.800
I know!

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:14.460
<i>How the heck did I end up in this mess?</i>

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:16.830
<i>This is my first time doing something like this,</i>

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:17.910
I guess he won't be able to drink yet, then.

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:20.660
<i>And I don't know anything about women.</i>

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:20.040
I'll get some sweets ready for him!

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:23.610
Oh, I want to touch that pointy hair too!

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:23.610
<i>More than that... More than that...</i>

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:27.960
<i>This is kind of scary!</i>

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:30.200
I guess in the end,

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:33.580
the cute ones get all the attention,
don't they, Mr. Yamanami?

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:36.620
Yes, they do. Even I'm jealous.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.620
You're one to talk.

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:42.830
It must be nice to have someone
who'll wait on you exclusively.

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:43.930
Oh, well...

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:54.080
Looks like they're here.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:00.430
Please pardon the wait.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.580
I am Akesato.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.040
Mister Yamanami, Mister Todo,

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:27.010
please enjoy yourselves tonight,
as you always do.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.060
Master...

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:41.020
Preparations for the outing have been made.

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:46.700
All right.

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:58.080
No matter how they may try
to dance like butterflies,

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.960
they are pitiful creatures
who can only live in the night.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.880
Are you referring to those
female ninja, the <i>kunoichi</i>?

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:07.080
With all due respect,

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:12.410
I have a difficult time understanding
why you keep them around.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:13.620
Oh?

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:14.890
Just the other day,

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:19.200
they said one of the <i>kunoichi </i>infiltrated
the Shinsengumi Headquarters,

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:25.520
but all she brought back were missives
written in a wormy hand by some nobody.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:30.870
Master Yoshida, I, Suzu,
am already fifteen.

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:32.950
I am no longer a child.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:36.870
Please, allow me to wield a
sword as your right-hand man!

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:42.500
Suzu... My right-hand man?

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.330
Those are quite brazen words.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:52.330
Oh, you need not be so impatient.

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:56.680
I'll let your brother's sword
drink of their blood.

00:15:57.580 --> 00:15:59.850
The blood of those cursed Shinsengumi.

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:04.810
Do not let it get to you so.

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:09.120
I'll be a little late.

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:11.580
Go on ahead without me.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:12.170
Yes, sir.

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:33.290
Brother...

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:34.240
Just a little longer.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:45.100
I will be the one to hunt down
those Wolves of Mibu!

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:51.290
<i>That Tetsu...</i>

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:55.860
<i>I know he's accompanying Mr. Yamanami,
but where the heck did he go?</i>

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:58.830
Thank you for your hard work,
taking over for Tetsu.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:02.790
Oh, not at all.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.920
There you go, eat up.

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:13.170
Excuse me, Mr. Okita?

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:16.580
Where do you suppose Tetsu has gone?

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:19.330
Oh, I haven't actually heard myself,

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:23.180
but Mr. Yamanami is with him,
so I'm sure he's fine.

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:25.060
You're right, of course.

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:29.000
Does it bother you?

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.080
Yes, well...

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:36.200
Tatsunosuke, you almost act
as if you're Tetsu's father.

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:42.120
Are all brothers like that?

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:46.660
I only have an elder sister,
so I don't really know.

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:47.710
He...

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:50.110
I was the one...

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:54.830
Oh, no...

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:58.000
Our father asked me to take care of him.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.040
That's why...

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:00.350
I see.

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.120
What could it be?

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:08.080
I don't know.

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.530
There now, Saizo.

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:14.370
That sure went well, didn't it?

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:15.860
Yeah.

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:19.410
I think he'll come back
looking a bit more refreshed.

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:22.000
But I haven't been in a while either,

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:25.250
so I wish I could've gone to Shimabara too.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:27.620
Shimabara?!

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:30.290
Is this true?!

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.120
Oh, sorry, man.

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:35.210
I didn't think things would
get settled on so easily, so...

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:46.600
Soul

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:40.450
Sannan and Heisuke are with him too,
so, well, I'm sure there'll be no problems.

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:42.700
If there were to be a problem,

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:45.220
that'd be whether he's up for it or not!

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:50.850
Shimabara...

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:55.500
Which means, a red-light district.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:56.400
Yeah.

00:18:57.750 --> 00:19:00.860
A red-light district means philandering.

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:03.280
Hello?

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:06.290
Philandering means...

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:12.290
I'll teach you everything.

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.190
Hello?

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:19.790
Mr. Harada, Mr. Nagakura, and Mr. Okita,

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:21.640
thank you for everything
you've done for me.

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:26.720
I will be going to Shimabara.

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:30.290
Our late mother and father

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:32.620
raised him with the utmost care
and affection for thirteen years!

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:35.290
These two tumultuous years
I sacrificed and dedicated myself

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:36.730
so that he might grow healthy and pure!

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:38.830
I do not recall raising him to be a man

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:41.320
who would give up his chastity to
some stranger from who knows where!

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:42.610
No!!

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:48.290
Onwards to Shimabara!

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:54.370
You're as beautiful as ever, Akesato.

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:56.460
My, that's lovely to hear.

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:58.630
That reminds me, Miss Akesato.

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:00.540
What is it?

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:05.950
Well, I'm not the only unwanted guest
for tonight. There's one more pup.

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:07.540
One pup?

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:11.640
