in the corner over there.

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:16.370
My, what an adorable boy! Is he a member?

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:19.150
Well, I'm not sure how to put it, but...

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:21.950
Oh, if it isn't Tetsunosuke!

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.910
Come on, it's me! Hana!

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:27.040
Hana?!

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.920
